{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2026-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1777593600, "end_date": 1778198399, "month_true_total": 212, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:49:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "224993293", "author": {"steamid": "76561199666931186", "personaname": "<IATPLMS>?", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199666931186/", "num_games_owned": 6, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 592, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 418, "last_played": 1778446975, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1778191180, "timestamp_updated": 1778191180, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224950179", "author": {"steamid": "76561198806818202", "personaname": "nostrovus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nostrovus/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 232940, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3600, "playtime_at_review": 196672, "last_played": 1790862464, "avatar": "c5f343d9f0d0fad32713353fd6c44e1e50742248"}, "language": "english", "review": "The roster appears big, but the devs only want you to play two characters. If you like any other character, you're just going to be disappointed over and over again.", "timestamp_created": 1778146847, "timestamp_updated": 1778146847, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50127875804901123", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224905906", "author": {"steamid": "76561198381989135", "personaname": "robinmarx78", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198381989135/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 63541, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 44860, "last_played": 1789581130, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun,fast paced", "timestamp_created": 1778086693, "timestamp_updated": 1778086693, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "224905870", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069135958", "personaname": "Roe Jogan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jillbutt69/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 136, "playtime_forever": 32, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32, "last_played": 1721606221, "avatar": "cde34570ee8d76077db475cf292a9a0161d68c7c"}, "language": "english", "review": "The First Descendant is a game that arrived wearing every cosmetic feature a live service looter shooter could possibly have and somehow managed to make all of it feel hollow simultaneously.\n\nNexon developed this one and if that name makes you instinctively check your privacy settings that instinct is not entirely without basis. Nexon has a long history of aggressive monetization practices that makes the tinfoil hat reaction less paranoid and more historically informed. The data concerns are real enough that it trended as a conversation topic at launch and the monetization structure is aggressive enough that it colors the entire experience even if you never spend a dollar.\n\nThe gameplay itself is Warframe adjacent in ways that are hard to ignore and impossible to unsee once you notice them. Which is fine except Warframe exists, is free, has over a decade of content, and has a developer relationship with its playerbase that Nexon has never historically demonstrated any interest in replicating.\n\nThe early hours not selling you is a pattern with this type of game but also a legitimate red flag specific to this one. Games that front load cosmetics and monetization while back loading meaningful content are making a specific bet about player psychology and it doesn't always pay off. If the hook isn't there in the first few hours with a live service game the grind required to reach the content that allegedly justifies everything before it is a significant ask.\n\nPretty exterior. Valid concerns underneath it. Warframe is right there.", "timestamp_created": 1778086661, "timestamp_updated": 1778086661, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.534282386302947998", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 26, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "224905032", "author": {"steamid": "76561198807572196", "personaname": "Vinslice", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198807572196/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6352, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 10, "playtime_at_review": 2506, "deck_playtime_at_review": 318, "last_played": 1790191870, "avatar": "b03a81d28ccb64afe1f8987f6276e49fa10909a6"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1778085831, "timestamp_updated": 1778085831, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": 